<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK MAY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.61 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK MAY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.61 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Wednesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.61 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for May 30			7,900</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for May		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to May 27			   6,827</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,611</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
